    "Near-floor dye sensitivity (z99 \u2265 90% of the configured depth): Fixed reference: z99=49.2 mm of H=50 mm at elapsed 13.9 s; Measured wave history: z99=49.4 mm of H=50 mm at elapsed 13.2 s; Wind + parent loss: z99=49.3 mm of H=50 mm at elapsed 13.9 s; Fixed reference \u00b7 refined: z99=47.3 mm of H=50 mm at elapsed 10.6 s; Wind + parent loss \u00b7 refined \u00b7 faster continuation: z99=48.6 mm of H=50 mm at elapsed 13.9 s. These depths may depend on the bottom boundary; further deepening needs a domain-depth sensitivity check.",
